Subject: v2 components: class style hooks, theme tokens, typed props

What: the v2 components the app renders carry `ui-*-v2` class hooks, take type,
radius and weight from the theme's tokens (so a theme restyles them), use logical
properties, and read item labels without casts (select-v2 through select-item).
Why: as for the original generation, class-keyed rules stay out of the shared
attribute bucket; tokens let the codex theme apply its type scale to v2.

